cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Nyxus in your work, please cite the software as below."
type: software
title: Nyxus
abstract: >-
  Scalable library for calculating features from intensity-label image data:
  intensity, texture, morphology and image quality features for every region of
  interest in 2D images and 3D volumes, from the command line or from Python.
authors:
